  "title": {"zh": "月亮池的遮光闸", "en": "Moonpool Shutters"},
  "concept": {"zh": "光闸反锁 · 双钥匙", "en": "Beam shutter · Two keys"},
  "brief": {
    "zh": "从月亮池北岸取回月影盘，送到南岸船坞。北岸铜钥匙打开盘箱，也会升起水面激光前的挡光闸。折回的光束覆盖所有过河石。西南泵房的踏板能给光束断电。东南的银钥匙打开通往盘箱的门。限 105 回合。",
    "en": "Fetch the moon disk from the north bank and return it to the south dock. The north brass key unlocks the chest and raises the shutter in front of the water laser. The reflected beam crosses every stepping-stone crossing. The southwest pump plate cuts its power. The silver key in the southeast opens the chest-room door. Finish within 105 turns."
  },
